{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Minecraft builder reference sheet, landscape 3:2. Vanilla Minecraft blocks only, crisp voxel style, plain light background, no characters or animals. Two views side by side: LEFT a straight-on north front elevation, strictly orthographic; RIGHT a north three-quarter view of the same estate at the same scale. Skilled human builder quality: real massing and depth, projecting galleries and recessed framed openings, actual stair/slab roof verges, eaves and ridge, fence balustrades, trapdoor shutters, lanterns. Show the complete 96 x 96 estate in each panel, with the mansion readable and the right view elevated enough to reveal grounds and river behind it. No inset views.\\nSite: A grand antebellum Greek Revival plantation estate on a river, seen from the north. A straight gravel drive runs from white gate piers with lanterns at the road, under an allee of eight huge spreading live oaks whose dark crowns meet overhead and drip with Spanish moss represented by vine and hanging_roots, to an oval gravel forecourt around a lawn island with a decorated_pot urn. Behind it stands the mansion, broad and symmetrical: a brilliant white two-storey block on a red-brick raised base with arched iron_bars vents. Across its whole front, exactly eight colossal white fluted quartz_pillar columns with block-built Ionic capitals rise the full two storeys. They carry a deep double gallery: a white-floored ground porch reached by wide smooth_quartz_stairs, and an upper porch with white birch_fence balustrades between columns. A plain white entablature and dentilled quartz cornice run above. One low, wide dark-slate hip roof has three white gabled dormers on the front, two on the back, and four red-brick chimneys with dark bands and stepped caps. Behind the columns, tall floor-length glass_pane windows hang between near-black dark_oak_trapdoor shutters. In the centre of each floor is a dark double 